  {
   "text": {
    "la": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Lex veritátis fuit in ore eius et iníquitas non est invénta in lábiis eius; in pace et in æquitáte ambulávit mecum, et multos avértit ab iniquitáte ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "(T. P. "
        },
        "allelúia",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": ")."
        }
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "en-US": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "The law of truth was in his mouth; no dishonesty was found on his lips. He walked with me in integrity and peace, and turned many away from evil ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "(E. T. "
        },
        "alleluia",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": ")"
        },
        "."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "es": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Transmitía la ley con fidelidad y no se encontraba fallo alguno en sus labios; caminaba conmigo en paz y en rectitud, y apartaba del pecado a mucha gente ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "(T. P."
        },
        " Aleluya",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": ")"
        },
        "."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "it": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Un insegnamento veritiero era sulla sua bocca, Ml 2, 6 né c'era falsità sulle sue labbra; con pace e rettitudine davanti a me ha camminato e molti ha fatto allontanare dal male ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "( T. P."
        },
        "Alleluia ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": ")."
        }
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "fr": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "La loi de vérité était dans sa bouche,"
       ],
       [
        "et rien de mal ne se trouvait sur ses lèvres."
       ],
       [
        "Dans la paix et la droiture, il marchait avec le Seigneur ;"
       ],
       [
        "nombreux furent ceux qu'il détourna de la faute ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "(T. P. "
        },
        "alléluia",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": ")."
        }
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "de": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Zuverlässige Bewährung kam aus seinem Mund, nichts Verkehrtes kam über seine Lippen. In Frieden und aufrichtig ging er seinen Weg mit Gott, und er bewahrte viele davor, schuldig zu werden."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "part": "entranceAntiphon"
  },
