  {
   "text": {
    "la": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Beáti mundo corde, quóniam ipsi Deum vidébunt; beáti pacífici, quóniam fílii Dei vocabúntur ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "(T. P. "
        },
        "allelúia",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": ")."
        }
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "en-US": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Blessed are the clean of heart, for they shall see God. Blessed are the peacemakers, for they shall be called children of God ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "(E. T. "
        },
        "alleluia",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": ")"
        },
        "."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "es": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Bienaventurados los limpios de corazón, porque ellos verán a Dios. Bienaventurados los que trabajan por la paz, porque ellos serán llamados hijos de Dios ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "(T. P."
        },
        " Aleluya",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": ")"
        },
        "."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "it": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Beati i puri di cuore: vedranno Dio. Mt 5, 8-9 Beati gli operatori di pace: saranno chiamati figli di Dio ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "( T. P."
        },
        "Alleluia ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": ")."
        }
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "fr": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Heureux les cœurs purs,"
       ],
       [
        "car ils verront Dieu."
       ],
       [
        "Heureux les artisans de paix,"
       ],
       [
        "car ils seront appelés fils de Dieu ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "(T. P. "
        },
        "alléluia",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": ")."
        }
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "de": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Selig, die ein reines Herz haben; denn sie werden Gott sehen. Selig, die Frieden stiften; denn sie werden Söhne Gottes genannt werden. Selig, die um der Gerechtigkeit willen verfolgt werden; denn ihnen gehört das Himmelreich."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
